        </div>
        <div class="px-6 py-5 prose-dark">
          <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Car Alpha's VIN decoder provides manufacturer specifications and open recall data. It is <strong>not</strong> a vehicle history report and does not include information about accidents, title status (salvage, rebuilt, flood), odometer readings, ownership history, lien status, or theft records.</p>
          <p class="text-silver-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">If you are purchasing a used vehicle, we strongly recommend obtaining a comprehensive vehicle history report from an established provider in addition to using our free VIN decoding and recall checking tools.</p>
        </div>
